@startuml
title Micro-HIS Dashboard base (ASII-26) - Vista de capas

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Presentation" #Paleturquoise {
  [bin/resumen_dashboard.php\n(front controller CLI)] as cli
}

package "Application" #LightBlue {
  [ResumenDashboard\n(caso de uso)] as uc
}

package "Domain" #LightYellow {
  [Indicador\n(entidad + regla de valor)] as ent
  [IndicadorRepository\n(puerto)] as port
}

package "Persistence" #LightGray {
  [IndicadorRepositoryEnMemoria\n(doble de prueba)] as mem
}

cli --> uc
uc --> ent
uc --> port
mem .up.|> port

note right of port
  Cada capa tiene una unica responsabilidad (SRP).
  La dependencia apunta al Dominio.
end note
@enduml
